window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.rowsHtml+="<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n716\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνόημα</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro, genitivo -ατος: falta involuntária, erro ou equívoco cometido por ignorância; Plutarco, Aristóteles e outros testemunhos preservados na fonte.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n717\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοηματίζω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo derivado de ἀγνόημα: cometer erro, agir equivocadamente ou incorrer em falta; atestação conforme TEI.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n718\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνόησις</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: ignorância, falta de compreensão; atestação conforme texto-fonte.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n719\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοητέον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbal impessoal, usualmente negado οὐκ ἀγνοητέον: não se deve deixar de observar, é necessário notar; Dioscórides e Fílon.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n720\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοητικός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν: equivocado, errado; de atos praticados por erro; Aristóteles, Ética a Eudemo 1246a48.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n721\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοητός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν: ignorado ou desconhecido; neutro τὸ ἀγνοητόν, o objeto do desconhecimento, Damáscio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n722\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγνοια</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino. I. Ignorância, falta de percepção ou saber, oposta a ἐπιστήμη, ciência; Ésquilo, Platão, Aristóteles. Em lógica, ignoratio elenchi, desconhecimento </td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n723\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοιῇσι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Forma épica ἀγνοιῇσι e correlatas: remissão à flexão de ἀγνοέω, sem acepção nova.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n724\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνόκοκκος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo masculino: vegetal equivalente a οἰσόκαρπος; Galeno, Eustácio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n725\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνοούντως</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Advérbio: ignorantemente, sem o devido conhecimento, por engano; Aristóteles, Tópicos 114b10.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n726\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνοπολέομαι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo médio/passivo: ser purificado por meio de sacrifícios; Fócio.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n727\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνοπόλος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: que purifica, que torna santo; de Deméter, Hinos Órficos 18.12. Comparação etimológica com τελέω é hipótese.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n728\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνόρυτος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: de águas ou correnteza límpidas, que flui puramente; de rio, Ésquilo, Prometeu 434.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n729\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνός</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Puro, casto, santo, consagrado, de festas, sacrifícios, templos, solo sagrado e água; Homero (Odisseia), Píndaro, tragédia. II. Deuses veneráveis e c</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n730\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγνος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, em ático também masculino: árvore-de-casto (Vitex agnus-castus), usada em ritos das Tesmofórias. A semelhança com ἁγνός motivou associação popular à</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n731\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνόστομος</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ον: de boca pura, fala limpa; Tzetzes, Histórias 6.33.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n732\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνοσύνη</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino: pureza, castidade, equivalente a ἁγνότης; Filodemo, Eranos.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n733\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνοτελής</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ές: objeto de culto por meio de cerimônias santas; de Têmis em composição órfica.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n734\"><td class=\"greek\">ἁγνότης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: pureza, castidade, integridade; inscrição de Argos e 2 Coríntios 6.5.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n735\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγνυμι</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo: partir, quebrar, despedaçar, fraturar. Futuro ἄξω, aoristos ἔαξα, ἦξα e passivo ἐάγην, perfeito ἔᾱγα com valor passivo; abundantes formas épicas. Ativo: quebrar es</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n736\"><td class=\"greek\">ἄγνυον</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo neutro, palavra de sentido duvidoso: talvez roda-d'água, papiro Londres 3.1177.149; hipótese não confirmada.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n737\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνύς</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ῦθος: peso de tear, contrapeso da tecelagem, frequentemente plural; Plutarco, Pólux.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n738\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνώδης</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Adjetivo -ες: falsa leitura por ἀκανθώδης, «espinhoso», em Teofrasto, História das plantas 3.18.4.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n739\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνωμονεύω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo ἀγνωμονεύω: falsa leitura por ἀγνωμονέω, registrada no passivo em Plutarco, De fraterno amore 484b.</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"search-row\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-target=\"entry-lsj-n740\"><td class=\"greek\">ἀγνωμονέω</td><td>LSJ</td><td>Verbo. I. Portar-se sem senso de justiça, agir com insensibilidade ou de modo injusto com alguém, usando εἰς, πρός, περί ou acusativo; Xenofonte, Demóstenes, Menandro, Pl</td><td>LSJ</td></tr>\n";
window.ScripturaLexicons.LSJ.cardsHtml+="<article id=\"entry-lsj-n716\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n716\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"726\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνόημα\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro, genitivo -ατος: falta involuntária, erro ou equívoco cometido por ignorância; Plutarco, Aristóteles e outros testemunhos\">ἀγνόημα</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro, genitivo -ατος: falta involuntária, erro ou equívoco cometido por ignorância; Plutarco, Aristóteles e outros testemunhos preservados na fonte.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Gorg. Hel. 19 · Thphr. HP 9.4.8 · D.S. 1.1 · Hipparch. 1.3.11 · LXX To. 3.3 · Ep.Hebr. 9.7 · PTeb. 5.3 · Str. 7.2.4 · Dam. Pr. 7</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gno/hma&quot; orig_id=&quot;n716&quot; key=&quot;a)gno/hma&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνό-ημα&quot;&gt;ἀγνόημα&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n716.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;fault of ignorance, oversight,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ψυχῆς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0593,003:19&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Gorg.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hel.&lt;/title&gt; 19&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. ἕτερον προσαγνοεῖν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:9:4:8&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 9.4.8&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0060,001:1:1&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.S.&lt;/author&gt; 1.1&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1431,001:1:3:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hipparch.&lt;/author&gt; 1.3.11&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0527,021:3:3&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;LXX&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;To.&lt;/title&gt; 3.3&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,019:9:7&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ep.Hebr.&lt;/title&gt; 9.7&lt;/bibl&gt;; in pl., opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁμαρτήματα,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Tebt.:5:3&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;PTeb.&lt;/title&gt; 5.3&lt;/bibl&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii B. C.)&lt;/date&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n716.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;ignorance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;περί τινος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0099,001:7:2:4&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Str.&lt;/author&gt; 7.2.4&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n716.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;object of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνοια,&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4066,003:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Dam.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 7&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n717\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n717\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"727\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοηματίζω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo derivado de ἀγνόημα: cometer erro, agir equivocadamente ou incorrer em falta; atestação conforme TEI.\">ἀγνοηματίζω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo derivado de ἀγνόημα: cometer erro, agir equivocadamente ou incorrer em falta; atestação conforme TEI.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnohmati/zw&quot; orig_id=&quot;n717&quot; key=&quot;a)gnohmati/zw&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνο-ηματίζω&quot;&gt;ἀγνοηματίζω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n717.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;fail to observe,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Aq.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ps.&lt;/title&gt; 118(119).10.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n718\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n718\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"728\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνόησις\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: ignorância, falta de compreensão; atestação conforme texto-fonte.\">ἀγνόησις</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: ignorância, falta de compreensão; atestação conforme texto-fonte.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gno/hsis&quot; orig_id=&quot;n718&quot; key=&quot;a)gno/hsis&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνό-ησις&quot;&gt;ἀγνόησις&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n718.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ignorance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 1.7.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n719\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n719\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"729\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοητέον\" data-meanings=\"Verbal impessoal, usualmente negado οὐκ ἀγνοητέον: não se deve deixar de observar, é necessário notar; Dioscórides e Fílon.\">ἀγνοητέον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbal impessoal, usualmente negado οὐκ ἀγνοητέον: não se deve deixar de observar, é necessário notar; Dioscórides e Fílon.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Ph. 1.11</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnohte/on&quot; orig_id=&quot;n719&quot; key=&quot;a)gnohte/on&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνο-ητέον&quot;&gt;ἀγνοητέον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n719.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;with neg., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;οὐκ ἀ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;one must not fail to remark,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Praef.&lt;/title&gt; 7, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0018,001:1:11&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ph.&lt;/author&gt; 1.11&lt;/bibl&gt;, al.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n720\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n720\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"730\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοητικός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν: equivocado, errado; de atos praticados por erro; Aristóteles, Ética a Eudemo 1246a48.\">ἀγνοητικός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν: equivocado, errado; de atos praticados por erro; Aristóteles, Ética a Eudemo 1246a48.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Arist. EE 1246a48</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnohtiko/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n720&quot; key=&quot;a)gnohtiko/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνο-ητικός&quot;&gt;ἀγνοητικός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n720.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;mistaken,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὰ ἀ. πράττειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,009:1246a:48&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EE&lt;/title&gt; 1246a48&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n721\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n721\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"731\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοητός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν: ignorado ou desconhecido; neutro τὸ ἀγνοητόν, o objeto do desconhecimento, Damáscio.\">ἀγνοητός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν: ignorado ou desconhecido; neutro τὸ ἀγνοητόν, o objeto do desconhecimento, Damáscio.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Dam. Pr. 6</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnohto/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n721&quot; key=&quot;a)gnohto/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνο-ητός&quot;&gt;ἀγνοητός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n721.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;ignored&lt;/i&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὸ -όν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;the object of ignorance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4066,003:6&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Dam.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 6&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n722\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n722\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"732\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγνοια\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino. I. Ignorância, falta de percepção ou saber, oposta a ἐπιστήμη, ciência; Ésquilo, Platão, Aristóteles. Em lógica, ignor\">ἄγνοια</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino. I. Ignorância, falta de percepção ou saber, oposta a ἐπιστήμη, ciência; Ésquilo, Platão, Aristóteles. Em lógica, ignoratio elenchi, desconhecimento das condições de refutação válida. II. Erro ou procedimento equivocado; Demóstenes, Políbio. Formas poéticas e jônicas ἀγνοίᾱ, ἀγνοίη.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">A. Ag. 1596 · Supp. 499 · S. Tr. 419 · X. Cyr. 3.1.38 · Th. 8.92 · Ar. Av. 577 · D. 9.64 · Pl. Tht. 199d · Arist. APr. 66b26 · Pl. R. 585b · Arist. EN 1110b25 · Arist. SE 168a18 · D. 18.133 · Ep. 2.19 · Plb. 27.2.2 · S. Tr. 350 · Ph. 129 · Moer. 191</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gnoia^&quot; orig_id=&quot;n722&quot; key=&quot;a)/gnoia^&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγνοιᾰ&quot;&gt;ἄγνοια&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, (v. &lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γιγνώσκω&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n722.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;want of perception, ignorance,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοίᾳ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:1596&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 1596&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοίας ὕπο&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,001:499&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 499&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἣν ὑπʼ ἀγνοίας ὁρᾷς&lt;/foreign&gt; whom seeing you &lt;i&gt;pretend not to know,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:419&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 419&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοίᾳ ἐξαμαρτάνειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,007:3:1:38&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cyr.&lt;/title&gt; 3.1.38&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:8:92&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 8.92&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,006:577&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Av.&lt;/title&gt; 577&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,009:64&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 9.64&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐπιστήμη,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,006:199d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tht.&lt;/title&gt; 199d&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,001:66b:26&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;APr.&lt;/title&gt; 66b26&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄ. κενότης ἐστὶ τῆς περὶ ψυχὴν ἕξεως&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,030:585b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;R.&lt;/title&gt; 585b&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;διʼ ἄγνοιαν πράττειν,&lt;/foreign&gt; opp. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοῶν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,010:1110b:25&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;EN&lt;/title&gt; 1110b25&lt;/bibl&gt;: in Logic, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἡ τοῦ ἐλέγχου ἄ.&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;lat&quot;&gt;ignoratio elenchi,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;ignorance&lt;/i&gt; of the conditions of a valid proof, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,039:168a:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;SE&lt;/title&gt; 168a18&lt;/bibl&gt;, al. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n722.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;mistaken conduct, a mistake,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:133&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.133&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,063:2:19&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ep.&lt;/title&gt; 2.19&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0543,001:27:2:2&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plb.&lt;/author&gt; 27.2.2&lt;/bibl&gt;. [In Poets sts. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοίᾱ,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:350&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 350&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,006:129&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 129&lt;/bibl&gt;; old &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Att.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, acc. to &lt;author&gt;Ael.Dion.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 11, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,1515,001:191&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Moer.&lt;/author&gt; 191&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοίη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Phot.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;]&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n723\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n723\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"733\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοιῇσι\" data-meanings=\"Forma épica ἀγνοιῇσι e correlatas: remissão à flexão de ἀγνοέω, sem acepção nova.\">ἀγνοιῇσι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Forma épica ἀγνοιῇσι e correlatas: remissão à flexão de ἀγνοέω, sem acepção nova.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnoih=|si&quot; orig_id=&quot;n723&quot; key=&quot;a)gnoih=|si&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνοιῇσι&quot;&gt;ἀγνοιῇσι&lt;/head&gt;, etc., v. ἀγνοέω.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n724\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n724\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"734\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνόκοκκος\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo masculino: vegetal equivalente a οἰσόκαρπος; Galeno, Eustácio.\">ἀγνόκοκκος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo masculino: vegetal equivalente a οἰσόκαρπος; Galeno, Eustácio.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Eust. 834.36</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gno/kokkos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n724&quot; key=&quot;a)gno/kokkos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνό-κοκκος&quot;&gt;ἀγνόκοκκος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n724.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= οἰσόκαρπος, &lt;author&gt;Gal.&lt;/author&gt; 14.552, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,4083,001:834:36&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Eust.&lt;/author&gt; 834.36&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n725\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n725\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"735\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνοούντως\" data-meanings=\"Advérbio: ignorantemente, sem o devido conhecimento, por engano; Aristóteles, Tópicos 114b10.\">ἀγνοούντως</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Advérbio: ignorantemente, sem o devido conhecimento, por engano; Aristóteles, Tópicos 114b10.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Arist. Top. 114b10</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnoou/ntws&quot; orig_id=&quot;n725&quot; key=&quot;a)gnoou/ntws&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνοούντως&quot;&gt;ἀγνοούντως&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n725.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνοέω,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;ignorantly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,044:114b:10&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Top.&lt;/title&gt; 114b10&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n726\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n726\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"736\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνοπολέομαι\" data-meanings=\"Verbo médio/passivo: ser purificado por meio de sacrifícios; Fócio.\">ἁγνοπολέομαι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo médio/passivo: ser purificado por meio de sacrifícios; Fócio.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gnopole/omai&quot; orig_id=&quot;n726&quot; key=&quot;a(gnopole/omai&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνο-πολέομαι&quot;&gt;ἁγνοπολέομαι&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n726.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to be purified by sacrifices,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Phot.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n727\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n727\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"737\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνοπόλος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: que purifica, que torna santo; de Deméter, Hinos Órficos 18.12. Comparação etimológica com τελέω é hipótese.\">ἁγνοπόλος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: que purifica, que torna santo; de Deméter, Hinos Órficos 18.12. Comparação etimológica com τελέω é hipótese.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Orph. H. 18.12 · A. 38</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gnopo/los&quot; orig_id=&quot;n727&quot; key=&quot;a(gnopo/los&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνο-πόλος&quot;&gt;ἁγνοπόλος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, (&lt;foreign lang=&quot;indo&quot;&gt;qṷel-,&lt;/foreign&gt; cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τελέω&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;i&gt;making pure,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Δημήτηρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,001:18:12&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 18.12&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,002:38&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;A.&lt;/title&gt; 38&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n728\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n728\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"738\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνόρυτος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: de águas ou correnteza límpidas, que flui puramente; de rio, Ésquilo, Prometeu 434.\">ἁγνόρυτος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: de águas ou correnteza límpidas, que flui puramente; de rio, Ésquilo, Prometeu 434.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">A. Pr. 434</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gno/ru^tos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n728&quot; key=&quot;a(gno/ru^tos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνό-ρῠτος&quot;&gt;ἁγνόρυτος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n728.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;pure-flowing,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ποταμός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:434&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 434&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; (lyr.).&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n729\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n729\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"739\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνός\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Puro, casto, santo, consagrado, de festas, sacrifícios, templos, solo sagrado e água; Homero (Odisseia), Píndaro, tragé\">ἁγνός</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ή, -όν. I. Puro, casto, santo, consagrado, de festas, sacrifícios, templos, solo sagrado e água; Homero (Odisseia), Píndaro, tragédia. II. Deuses veneráveis e castos, especialmente Ártemis, Perséfone, Deméter, Apolo, Zeus. III. De pessoas: casto, incontaminado, inclusive quanto ao matrimônio. IV. Livre de culpa, de sangue ou homicídio, purificado; mãos puras, com genitivo. V. Íntegro, digno, reto. Advérbio ἁγνῶς, puramente; subdivisões documentadas no TEI.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Od. 21.259 · Xenoph. 1.7 · h.Merc. 187 · Pi. P. 4.204 · Id. I. 6(5).74 · Id. P. 1.21 · A. Pr. 282 · S. El. 86 · Ant. 1201 · Id. Tr. 287 · Th. 1.126 · D.H. 1.38 · Jul. Or. 6.192c · E. Ion 243 · A. Supp. 223 · S. OC 37 · Od. 5.123 · 18.202 · 11.386 · h.Cer. 337 · h.Cer. 203 · 439 · Pi. P. 9.64 · A. Supp. 653 · S. Ph. 1289 · S. OT 830 · Alc. 55 · Pi. P. 4.103 · A. Fr. 242 · Ag. 245 · E. Hipp. 102 · 1003 · Pl. Lg. 840d · Men. Epit. 223 · D. 59.78 · S. Ant. 889 · E. Or. 1604 · Id. El. 975 · IA 940 · S. Tr. 258 · E. Hipp. 316 · Pl. Lg. 759c · E. Hipp. 138 · Pi. O. 3.21 · X. Smp. 8.15 · h.Ap. 121 · Hes. Op. 337 · X. Mem. 3.8.10</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gno/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n729&quot; key=&quot;a(gno/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνός&quot;&gt;ἁγνός&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ή&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;όν&lt;/itype&gt;, (cf. &lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἅγιος&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n729.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;pure, chaste, holy,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt; (only in &lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt;), etc.: &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;I&quot; id=&quot;n729.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of places and things dedicated to gods, &lt;i&gt;hallowed,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἑορτή&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:21:259&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 21.259&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; of frankincense, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνὴ ὀδμή&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0267,001:1:7&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Xenoph.&lt;/author&gt; 1.7&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄλσος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,004:187&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Merc.&lt;/title&gt; 187&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τέμενος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:4:204&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 4.204&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὕδωρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,004:6:74&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;I.&lt;/title&gt; 6(5).74&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πυρὸς ἁγνόταται παγαί&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:1:21&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 1.21&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;αἰθήρ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,003:282&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Pr.&lt;/title&gt; 282&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φάος, λουτρόν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,005:86&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 86&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,002:1201&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ant.&lt;/title&gt; 1201&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θύματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:287&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 287&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0003,001:1:126&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Th.&lt;/author&gt; 1.126&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0081,001:1:38&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.H.&lt;/author&gt; 1.38&lt;/bibl&gt;; of food, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2003,001:6:192c&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Jul.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 6.192c&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;comp&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Comp.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;); &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χρηστήρια&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,010:243&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ion&lt;/title&gt; 243&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc.; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν ἁγνῷ&lt;/foreign&gt; on &lt;i&gt;holy&lt;/i&gt; ground, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,001:223&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 223&lt;/bibl&gt;, but &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χῶρον οὐχ ἁ. πατεῖν&lt;/foreign&gt; a spot not &lt;i&gt;lawful&lt;/i&gt; to tread on, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,007:37&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OC&lt;/title&gt; 37&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n729.2&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; of divine persons, &lt;i&gt;chaste, pure,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, mostly of Artemis, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;χρυσόθρονος Ἄ. ἁ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:5:123&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 5.123&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:18:202&quot;&gt;18.202&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc.; also &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. Περσεφόνεια&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:11:386&quot;&gt;11.386&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,002:337&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Cer.&lt;/title&gt; 337&lt;/bibl&gt;; of Demeter, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,002:203&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Cer.&lt;/title&gt; 203&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,002:439&quot;&gt;439&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Χάριτες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Sapph.&lt;/author&gt; 65&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. θεαί,&lt;/foreign&gt; Demeter and Persephone, &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 14.204, 4.31; Apollo, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:9:64&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 9.64&lt;/bibl&gt;; Zeus, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,001:653&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Supp.&lt;/title&gt; 653&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,006:1289&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ph.&lt;/title&gt; 1289&lt;/bibl&gt;: of the attributes of gods, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;θεῶν σέβας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,004:830&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;OT&lt;/title&gt; 830&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n729.3&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; after &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, of persons, &lt;i&gt;undefiled, chaste,&lt;/i&gt; of maidens, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0383,001:55&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Alc.&lt;/author&gt; 55&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,002:4:103&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;P.&lt;/title&gt; 4.103&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,008:242&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;A.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 242&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. αὐδά,&lt;/foreign&gt; of a maidenʼs voice, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0085,005:245&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Ag.&lt;/title&gt; 245&lt;/bibl&gt;; of Hippolytus, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:102&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hipp.&lt;/title&gt; 102&lt;/bibl&gt;; c. gen., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;λέχους ἁ. δέμας&lt;/foreign&gt; ib. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:1003&quot;&gt;1003&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;γάμων ἁ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:840d&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 840d&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0541,009:223&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epit.&lt;/title&gt; 223&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. ἀπʼ ἀνδρὸς συνουσίας&lt;/foreign&gt; Jusj. ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,059:78&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 59.78&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n729.4&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;pure from blood, guiltless,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνοὶ τοὐπὶ τήνδε τὴν κόρην&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,002:889&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Ant.&lt;/title&gt; 889&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. χεῖρας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,016:1604&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 1604&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μητροκτόνος . . τόθʼ ἁ. ὤν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,012:975&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;El.&lt;/title&gt; 975&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,018:940&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;IA&lt;/title&gt; 940&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὅθʼ ἁ. ἦν&lt;/foreign&gt; when he had been &lt;i&gt;purified,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0011,001:258&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;S.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tr.&lt;/title&gt; 258&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. gen., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνὰς χεῖρας αἵματος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:316&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hipp.&lt;/title&gt; 316&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;φόνου&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,034:759c&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Lg.&lt;/title&gt; 759c&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Δάματρος ἀκτᾶς δέμας ἁ. ἴσχειν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;pure&lt;/i&gt; from food, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,005:138&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hipp.&lt;/title&gt; 138&lt;/bibl&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;3&quot; id=&quot;n729.5&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; generally, &lt;i&gt;pure, upright,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀέθλων ἁ. κρίσις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0033,001:3:21&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pi.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;O.&lt;/title&gt; 3.21&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ψυχῆς φιλία ἁ.&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,004:8:15&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Smp.&lt;/title&gt; 8.15&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, etc. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n729.6&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adv.&lt;/pos&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνῶς καὶ καθαρῶς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,003:121&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Ap.&lt;/title&gt; 121&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,002:337&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Op.&lt;/title&gt; 337&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁ. ἔχειν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,002:3:8:10&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Mem.&lt;/title&gt; 3.8.10&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n730\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n730\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"740\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγνος\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, em ático também masculino: árvore-de-casto (Vitex agnus-castus), usada em ritos das Tesmofórias. A semelhança com ἁγνό\">ἄγνος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, em ático também masculino: árvore-de-casto (Vitex agnus-castus), usada em ritos das Tesmofórias. A semelhança com ἁγνός motivou associação popular à castidade. Também nome masculino de peixe e nome de uma espécie de ave nos escólios.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">h.Merc. 410 · Chionid. 2 · Pl. Phdr. 230b · Hp. Int. 30 · Arist. HA 627a9 · Nic. Th. 71 · Ath. 8.356a</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gnos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n730&quot; key=&quot;a)/gnos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγνος&quot;&gt;ἄγνος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Att.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n730.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= λύγος, &lt;i&gt;chaste-tree,&lt;/i&gt; the branches of which were strewed by matrons on their beds at the Thesmophoria, &lt;i&gt;Vitex Agnus-castus,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0013,004:410&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;h.Merc.&lt;/title&gt; 410&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0431,001:2&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Chionid.&lt;/author&gt; 2&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;title&gt;Trag.Adesp.&lt;/title&gt; 396, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0059,012:230b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phdr.&lt;/title&gt; 230b&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,032:30&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Int.&lt;/title&gt; 30&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0086,014:627a:9&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Arist.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HA&lt;/title&gt; 627a9&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0022,001:71&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Nic.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Th.&lt;/title&gt; 71&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;author&gt;Dsc.&lt;/author&gt; 1.103. (Associated with the notion of chastity from the likeness of its name to &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνός.&lt;/foreign&gt;) &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;II&quot; id=&quot;n730.1&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;orth lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνος&lt;/orth&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ὁ&lt;/gen&gt;, name of &lt;i&gt;a fish,&lt;/i&gt; = καλλιώνυμος &lt;author&gt;Diph.Siph.&lt;/author&gt; ap. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0008,001:8:356a&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ath.&lt;/author&gt; 8.356a&lt;/bibl&gt; (sine acc. cod., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἁγνός&lt;/foreign&gt; Kaib.). &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;III&quot; id=&quot;n730.2&quot; level=&quot;2&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; a kind of &lt;i&gt;bird,&lt;/i&gt; Sch. &lt;author&gt;Pl.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Phdr.&lt;/title&gt; l.c., &lt;author&gt;Suid.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n731\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n731\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"741\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνόστομος\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ον: de boca pura, fala limpa; Tzetzes, Histórias 6.33.\">ἁγνόστομος</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ον: de boca pura, fala limpa; Tzetzes, Histórias 6.33.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Tz. H. 6.33</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gno/stomos&quot; orig_id=&quot;n731&quot; key=&quot;a(gno/stomos&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνό-στομος&quot;&gt;ἁγνόστομος&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ον&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n731.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;with pure mouth,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,9022,001:6:33&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Tz.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;H.&lt;/title&gt; 6.33&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n732\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n732\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"742\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνοσύνη\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino: pureza, castidade, equivalente a ἁγνότης; Filodemo, Eranos.\">ἁγνοσύνη</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino: pureza, castidade, equivalente a ἁγνότης; Filodemo, Eranos.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gnosu/nh&quot; orig_id=&quot;n732&quot; key=&quot;a(gnosu/nh&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνο-σύνη&quot;&gt;ἁγνοσύνη&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n732.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;= ἁγνότης, &lt;title&gt;Eranos&lt;/title&gt; 13.87 (loc. incert.), &lt;author&gt;Phld.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;D.&lt;/title&gt; 3&lt;title&gt;Fr.&lt;/title&gt; 76.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n733\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n733\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"743\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνοτελής\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ές: objeto de culto por meio de cerimônias santas; de Têmis em composição órfica.\">ἁγνοτελής</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ές: objeto de culto por meio de cerimônias santas; de Têmis em composição órfica.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Orph. A. 551</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gnotelh/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n733&quot; key=&quot;a(gnotelh/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;suff&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνο-τελής&quot;&gt;ἁγνοτελής&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ές&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n733.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;worshipped in holy rites,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;Θέμις&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0579,002:551&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Orph.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;A.&lt;/title&gt; 551&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n734\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n734\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"744\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἁγνότης\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: pureza, castidade, integridade; inscrição de Argos e 2 Coríntios 6.5.\">ἁγνότης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ητος: pureza, castidade, integridade; inscrição de Argos e 2 Coríntios 6.5.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">2 Ep.Cor. 6.5</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa(gno/ths&quot; orig_id=&quot;n734&quot; key=&quot;a(gno/ths&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἁγνότης&quot;&gt;ἁγνότης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ητος&lt;/itype&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἁγνός&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;sense id=&quot;n734.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;purity, chastity, integrity,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;IG&lt;/title&gt; 4.588.15 (&lt;placeName&gt;Argos&lt;/placeName&gt;, &lt;date&gt;ii A.D.&lt;/date&gt;), &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0031,008:6:5&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;2 Ep.Cor.&lt;/title&gt; 6.5&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n735\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n735\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"745\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγνυμι\" data-meanings=\"Verbo: partir, quebrar, despedaçar, fraturar. Futuro ἄξω, aoristos ἔαξα, ἦξα e passivo ἐάγην, perfeito ἔᾱγα com valor passivo; abundantes fo\">ἄγνυμι</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo: partir, quebrar, despedaçar, fraturar. Futuro ἄξω, aoristos ἔαξα, ἦξα e passivo ἐάγην, perfeito ἔᾱγα com valor passivo; abundantes formas épicas. Ativo: quebrar escudo, jugo, lança, barco e galhos, inclusive ondas; Homero. Passivo: ser partido; figuradamente rio sinuoso ou som propagado. Ativo ausente da prosa corrente, na qual se emprega κατάγνυμι.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Il. 8.403 · Ar. V. 1436 · Il. 23.392 · Hp. Epid. 5.26 · Il. 6.306 · 16.371 · E. Hel. 1598 · Lys. 3.42 · Il. 21.178 · Il. 11.559 · Il. 3.367 · 4.214 · Hes. Op. 534 · Q.S. 1.204 · Hdt. 7.224 · Hp. Fract. 24 · Luc. Tim. 10 · Hdn.Gr. 2.14 · Il. 7.270 · 23.392 · Od. 3.298 · 5.385 · Il. 12.148 · APl. 16.250 · 16.801 · 13.162 · 16.769 · Od. 10.123 · Il. 4.214 · Hdt. 1.185 · Hes. Sc. 279 · 348</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gnu_mi&quot; orig_id=&quot;n735&quot; key=&quot;a)/gnu_mi&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγνῡμι&quot;&gt;ἄγνυμι&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;per opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;3&lt;/per&gt; &lt;number opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;dual&lt;/number&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνῠτον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr.: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;fut.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄξω &lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;κατ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:8:403&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 8.403&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor.1&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔαξα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;κατ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0019,004:1436&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Ar.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;V.&lt;/title&gt; 1436&lt;/bibl&gt;, etc., &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἦξα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:392&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 23.392&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;κατ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,006:5:26&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Epid.&lt;/title&gt; 5.26&lt;/bibl&gt;; imper. &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἆξον&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:6:306&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 6.306&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;part.&lt;/mood&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄξας&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:16:371&quot;&gt;16.371&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0006,014:1598&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;E.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Hel.&lt;/title&gt; 1598&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατ-εάξαντες&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0540,003:42&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Lys.&lt;/author&gt; 3.42&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; codd., perh. to distinguish it from &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor. 1&lt;/tns&gt; of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγω&lt;/foreign&gt;); &lt;mood opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;inf.&lt;/mood&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἆξαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:21:178&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 21.178&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pres.&lt;/tns&gt;, &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; infr.: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;aor. 2&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐάγην &lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;pron extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ᾰ&lt;/pron&gt;, exc. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐᾱγη&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:11:559&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 11.559&lt;/bibl&gt;) &lt;author&gt;Hom.&lt;/author&gt;, etc.; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ep.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; 3 sing. &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγη&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:3:367&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 3.367&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;per opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;3&lt;/per&gt; &lt;number opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pl.&lt;/number&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγεν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:4:214&quot;&gt;4.214&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; (in pass. sense) &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔᾱγα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,002:534&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Op.&lt;/title&gt; 534&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2046,001:1:204&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Q.S.&lt;/author&gt; 1.204&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;dialect&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Ion.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔηγα&lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;etym lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;κατ-&lt;/etym&gt;) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:7:224&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 7.224&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0627,009:24&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hp.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Fract.&lt;/title&gt; 24&lt;/bibl&gt;: &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατ-έαγμαι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0062,022:10&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Luc.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Tim.&lt;/title&gt; 10&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: (&lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ϝ&lt;/itype&gt;, cf. &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;καυάξαις; ᾰ&lt;/foreign&gt; by nature, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἆξον&lt;/foreign&gt; (&lt;bibl default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdn.Gr.&lt;/author&gt; 2.14&lt;/bibl&gt;), &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἆξαι&lt;/foreign&gt; on analogy of &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;var&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;contr.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; forms of &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατα-ϝάγνυμι&lt;/foreign&gt;):—&lt;sense id=&quot;n735.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;break, shiver,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;εἴσω δʼ ἀσπίδʼ ἔαξε&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:7:270&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 7.270&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἦξε θεὰ ζυγόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:23:392&quot;&gt;23.392&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἵπποι ἄξαντʼ ἐν πρώτῳ ῥυμῷ λίπον ἅρματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:16:371&quot;&gt;16.371&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νῆας . . ἔαξαν κύματα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:3:298&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 3.298&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρό τε κύματʼ ἔαξεν&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;broke&lt;/i&gt; the waves, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:5:385&quot;&gt;5.385&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνυτον ὕλην&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;crashed through&lt;/i&gt; it, of wild boars, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:12:148&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 12.148&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνυσι κεραυνόν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,7000,001:16:250&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;APl.&lt;/title&gt; 16.250&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, with &lt;tns opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;pf.&lt;/tns&gt; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἔᾱγα,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;to be broken, shivered,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν χείρεσσιν ἄγη ξίφος&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:3:367&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 3.367&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;. cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:16:801&quot;&gt;16.801&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἐν καυλῷ ἐάγη δολιχὸν δόρυ&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:13:162&quot;&gt;13.162&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πάταγος. . ἀγνυμενάων&lt;/foreign&gt; (sc. of the trees) &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:16:769&quot;&gt;16.769&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;νηῶν θʼ ἅμα ἀγνυμενάων&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,002:10:123&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Od.&lt;/title&gt; 10.123&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τοῦ [ὀϊστοῦ] δʼ ἐξελκομένοιο πάλιν ἄγεν ὀξέες ὄγκοι&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0012,001:4:214&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Il.&lt;/title&gt; 4.214&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ποταμὸς περὶ καμπὰς πολλὰς ἀγνύμενος&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;with a broken,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;abbr&gt;i.e.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;i&gt;winding, course,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0016,001:1:185&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt; 1.185&lt;/bibl&gt;: metaph., &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἄγνυτο ἠχώ&lt;/foreign&gt; the sound &lt;i&gt;spread around,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,003:279&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hes.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sc.&lt;/title&gt; 279&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0020,003:348&quot;&gt;348&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κέλαδος ἀγνύμενος διὰ στομάτων,&lt;/foreign&gt; of the notes of song, &lt;title&gt;Lyr.Adesp.&lt;/title&gt; 93.—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Act.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; never in Prose, &lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt; once in &lt;author&gt;Hdt.&lt;/author&gt;, &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;κατάγνυμι&lt;/foreign&gt; being in general use.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n736\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n736\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"746\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἄγνυον\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo neutro, palavra de sentido duvidoso: talvez roda-d'água, papiro Londres 3.1177.149; hipótese não confirmada.\">ἄγνυον</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo neutro, palavra de sentido duvidoso: talvez roda-d'água, papiro Londres 3.1177.149; hipótese não confirmada.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\"></p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)/gnuon&quot; orig_id=&quot;n736&quot; key=&quot;a)/gnuon&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἄγνυον&quot;&gt;ἄγνυον&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;τό&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n736.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;doubtful word, perh. &lt;i&gt;water-wheel,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PLond.&lt;/title&gt; 3.1177.149.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n737\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n737\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"747\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνύς\" data-meanings=\"Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ῦθος: peso de tear, contrapeso da tecelagem, frequentemente plural; Plutarco, Pólux.\">ἀγνύς</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Substantivo feminino, genitivo -ῦθος: peso de tear, contrapeso da tecelagem, frequentemente plural; Plutarco, Pólux.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Hdn.Gr. 2.763 · Plu. Symp. 2.156b · Poll. 7.36</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnu/s&quot; orig_id=&quot;n737&quot; key=&quot;a)gnu/s&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνύς&quot;&gt;ἀγνύς&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ῦθος&lt;/itype&gt; (on the accent &lt;abbr&gt;v.&lt;/abbr&gt; &lt;bibl default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Hdn.Gr.&lt;/author&gt; 2.763&lt;/bibl&gt;), &lt;gen lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ἡ&lt;/gen&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n737.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;loom-weight,&lt;/i&gt; in pl., &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,079:156:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Symp.&lt;/title&gt; 2.156b&lt;/bibl&gt;, cf. &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0542,001:7:36&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Poll.&lt;/author&gt; 7.36&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n738\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n738\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"748\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνώδης\" data-meanings=\"Adjetivo -ες: falsa leitura por ἀκανθώδης, «espinhoso», em Teofrasto, História das plantas 3.18.4.\">ἀγνώδης</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Adjetivo -ες: falsa leitura por ἀκανθώδης, «espinhoso», em Teofrasto, História das plantas 3.18.4.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Thphr. HP 3.18.4</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnw/dhs&quot; orig_id=&quot;n738&quot; key=&quot;a)gnw/dhs&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνώδης&quot;&gt;ἀγνώδης&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;itype lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;ες&lt;/itype&gt;, f.l. for ἀκανθώδης, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0093,001:3:18:4&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Thphr.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HP&lt;/title&gt; 3.18.4&lt;/bibl&gt;.&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n739\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n739\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"749\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνωμονεύω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo ἀγνωμονεύω: falsa leitura por ἀγνωμονέω, registrada no passivo em Plutarco, De fraterno amore 484b.\">ἀγνωμονεύω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo ἀγνωμονεύω: falsa leitura por ἀγνωμονέω, registrada no passivo em Plutarco, De fraterno amore 484b.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Plu. Frat. 2.484b</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnwmoneu/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n739&quot; key=&quot;a)gnwmoneu/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνωμονεύω&quot;&gt;ἀγνωμονεύω&lt;/head&gt;, f.l. for -εω, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,097:484:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Frat.&lt;/title&gt; 2.484b&lt;/bibl&gt; (&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;).&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n<article id=\"entry-lsj-n740\" class=\"entry-card\" data-dictionary=\"grego\" data-source=\"LSJ\" data-lsj-orig-id=\"n740\" data-lsj-ordinal=\"750\" hidden><h1 class=\"entry-title greek tooltip-trigger\" data-tooltip-type=\"greek\" data-tooltip-label=\"ἀγνωμονέω\" data-meanings=\"Verbo. I. Portar-se sem senso de justiça, agir com insensibilidade ou de modo injusto com alguém, usando εἰς, πρός, περί ou acusativo; Xenof\">ἀγνωμονέω</h1><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Tradução portuguesa do artigo</div><p class=\"entry-text\">Verbo. I. Portar-se sem senso de justiça, agir com insensibilidade ou de modo injusto com alguém, usando εἰς, πρός, περί ou acusativo; Xenofonte, Demóstenes, Menandro, Plutarco. II. Desobedecer a convocação, ser contumaz, papiro. III. Passivo, sofrer injustiça ou falta de consideração. IV. Agir sem bom senso ou imprudentemente; Áquila, 1 Reis 13.13.</p></section><section class=\"entry-section\"><div class=\"section-title\">Referências da fonte</div><p class=\"entry-text\">X. HG 1.7.33 · D. 18.94 · Men. Sam. 292 · Apollod.Com. 7.6 · Plu. Alc. 19 · Cam. 28 · Him. Or. 2.31 · Plu. Frat. 2.484b · Id. Cam. 18 · POxy. 237v40</p></section><details><summary>Texto TEI original integral para cotejo filológico</summary><pre style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere\">&lt;div2 id=&quot;crossa)gnwmone/w&quot; orig_id=&quot;n740&quot; key=&quot;a)gnwmone/w&quot; type=&quot;main&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;head extent=&quot;full&quot; lang=&quot;grc&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot; orth_orig=&quot;ἀγνωμ-ονέω&quot;&gt;ἀγνωμονέω&lt;/head&gt;, &lt;sense id=&quot;n740.0&quot; n=&quot;&quot; level=&quot;1&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;to be &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνώμων,&lt;/foreign&gt;&lt;/i&gt; &lt;i&gt;act without right feeling,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0032,001:1:7:33&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;X.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;HG&lt;/title&gt; 1.7.33&lt;/bibl&gt;; coupled with &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀδικεῖν,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;author&gt;Zeno Stoic.&lt;/author&gt; 1.69; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. εἴς τινα&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;i&gt;to act unfeelingly&lt;/i&gt; or &lt;i&gt;unfairly towards&lt;/i&gt; one, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0014,018:94&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;D.&lt;/author&gt; 18.94&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0541,029:292&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Men.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Sam.&lt;/title&gt; 292&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;πρός τινα&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0412,001:7:6&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Apollod.Com.&lt;/author&gt; 7.6&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;: with a neut. &lt;pos opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Adj.&lt;/pos&gt;, &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;μή νυν τὰ θνητὰ θνητὸς ὢν ἀγνωμόνει&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;title&gt;Trag.Adesp.&lt;/title&gt; 112&lt;/cit&gt;: abs., &lt;i&gt;disregard a summons, be contumacious,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;title&gt;PStrassb.&lt;/title&gt; 41.16 &lt;date&gt;(iii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;; &lt;foreign lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀ. περί τινα, περί τι,&lt;/foreign&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,015:19&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Alc.&lt;/title&gt; 19&lt;/bibl&gt;, &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,011:28&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;Cam.&lt;/title&gt; 28&lt;/bibl&gt;: c. acc., &lt;i&gt;treat unfairly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;τὴν πόλιν&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,2051,001:2:31&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Him.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Or.&lt;/title&gt; 2.31&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;:—&lt;gramGrp opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;&lt;gram type=&quot;voice&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt;Pass.&lt;/gram&gt;&lt;/gramGrp&gt;, &lt;i&gt;to be so treated,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,097:484:b&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Plu.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Frat.&lt;/title&gt; 2.484b&lt;/bibl&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ἀγνωμονηθείς&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:tlg,0007,011:18&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;author&gt;Id.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;Cam.&lt;/title&gt; 18&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt;; &lt;cit&gt;&lt;quote lang=&quot;grc&quot;&gt;ὑπὸ τοῦ πατρός&lt;/quote&gt; &lt;bibl n=&quot;Perseus:abo:pap,P.Oxy.:237v40&quot; default=&quot;NO&quot;&gt;&lt;title&gt;POxy.&lt;/title&gt; 237v40&lt;/bibl&gt;&lt;/cit&gt; &lt;date&gt;(ii A.D.)&lt;/date&gt;. &lt;/sense&gt;&lt;sense n=&quot;2&quot; id=&quot;n740.1&quot; level=&quot;3&quot; opt=&quot;n&quot;&gt; &lt;i&gt;act ill-advisedly,&lt;/i&gt; &lt;author&gt;Aq.&lt;/author&gt; &lt;title&gt;1 Ki.&lt;/title&gt; 13.13.&lt;/sense&gt;&lt;/div2&gt;</pre></details></article>\n";
